Boastful kings shake earth heading homeward --- Kings claim they would have slain Rāvaṇa --- Kings send varied jewels gifts pleasing Rāma --- Bharata Lakṣmaṇa Śatrughna bear gifts to Ayōdhyā --- Princes deliver all jewels to great Rāma --- Rāma grants all to Sugrīva Vibhīṣaṇa monkeys --- Heroes bear gifts joyfully on heads arms --- All drink wines eat meats taste fruits --- All feast two months like moments devotedly